<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Compte réactivé</title>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: light; }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { body { background: #f0f9ff !important; } }
    body { margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f0f9ff; font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; }
    .container { max-width:560px; margin:0 auto; padding:16px; }
    .card { background:#ffffff; border-radius:16px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; overflow:hidden; box-shadow:0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); }
    .header { background:#0284c7; padding:32px 20px; text-align:center; }
    .header h1 { margin:0; color:#ffffff; font-size:28px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-0.025em; }
    .header span { display:block; color:#bae6fd; font-size:14px; font-weight:300; margin-top:4px; }
    .body { padding:24px 20px; }
    .body p { margin:0 0 16px; line-height:1.6; color:#475569; font-size:15px; }
    .body .greeting { font-size:20px; font-weight:600; color:#0c4a6e; margin:0 0 8px; }
    .body .info-box { background:#f0f9ff; border-left:4px solid #0ea5e9; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin:0 0 16px; }
    .body .info-box p { margin:0; font-size:14px; color:#0c4a6e; }
    .body .btn-wrapper { text-align:center; margin:0 0 20px; }
    .body .btn { display:inline-block; background:#0284c7; color:#ffffff; font-weight:500; font-size:15px; padding:12px 32px; border-radius:8px; text-decoration:none; }
    .body .signature { border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-top:20px; margin-top:8px; }
    .body .signature p { margin:0; font-size:15px; color:#475569; }
    .body .signature .team { color:#0c4a6e; font-weight:600; }
    .footer { padding:16px 32px; background:#f2f6fa; border-top:1px solid #dce5ef; text-align:center; font-size:11px; color:#7a9ab5; line-height:1.5; }
    .footer .copy { margin:6px 0 0; color:#9ab0c8; }
    @media (max-width:600px) {
      .header, .body, .footer { padding-left:16px; padding-right:16px; }
      .btn { display:block; text-align:center; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#f0f9ff; padding:16px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:560px; background:#ffffff; border-radius:16px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0; overflow:hidden;">
          <tr>
            <td style="background:#0284c7; padding:32px 20px; text-align:center;">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" style="padding-bottom:8px;">
                    <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="display:block; margin:0 auto; color:#ffffff; opacity:0.85;">
                      <path d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41L9 16.17z" fill="currentColor"/>
                    </svg>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td align="center">
                    <span style="color:#ffffff; font-size:28px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-0.025em;">Compte réactivé</span>
                    <span style="display:block; color:#bae6fd; font-size:14px; font-weight:300; margin-top:4px;">Bienvenue à nouveau</span>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:24px 20px;">
              <p style="margin:0 0 8px; font-size:20px; font-weight:600; color:#0c4a6e;">
                Bonjour{{#if firstName}} {{firstName}} {{lastName}}{{/if}},
              </p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:15px; color:#475569; line-height:1.6;">
                Votre compte a été réactivé. Vous pouvez à nouveau accéder à tous nos services.
              </p>

              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f0f9ff; border-left:4px solid #0ea5e9; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin:0 0 16px;">
                <tr>
                  <td>
                    <p style="font-size:14px; color:#0c4a6e; margin:0;">Vous pouvez dès maintenant vous connecter et reprendre vos démarches.</p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              {{#if FRONTEND_URL}}
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="text-align:center; margin:0 0 20px;">
                  <tr>
                    <td align="center">
                      <a href="{{FRONTEND_URL}}" style="display:inline-block; background:#0284c7; color:#ffffff; font-weight:500; font-size:15px; padding:12px 32px; border-radius:8px; text-decoration:none;">Se connecter</a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              {{/if}}

              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-top:20px; margin-top:8px;">
                <tr>
                  <td>
                    <p style="margin:0 0 4px; font-size:15px; color:#475569;">Nous sommes heureux de vous compter parmi nous,</p>
                    <p style="margin:0; font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#0c4a6e;">L'équipe Paname Consulting</p>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:16px 32px; background:#f2f6fa; border-top:1px solid #dce5ef; text-align:center; font-size:11px; color:#7a9ab5; line-height:1.5;">
              <p style="margin:0;">Cet email a été envoyé automatiquement, merci de ne pas y répondre.</p>
              <p style="margin:6px 0 0; color:#9ab0c8;">&copy; {{year}} Paname Consulting</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>